# Only what the image is built from: no state, caches, secrets (*.env), tests or venv can reach it (the scripts are there to be run
# in the container: docker compose exec ecobot python scripts/...)
*
!ecobot.py
!lib/
!scripts/
!requirements.txt
# the commit the log says it is running is read from these (a clone; the files are a few hundred bytes)
!.git/HEAD
!.git/refs/heads/
!.git/packed-refs
**/__pycache__
